    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Game</h2>Brave Heroes is a game where you can play with different heroes with different move abilities and try to complete 4 seasons total of 20 minutes, with the powerful abilities and the help of the environment and nature.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discord Channel</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Abilities</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073970/extras/cc9a10e3de1cdd6c02c93dc2719e40ae.poster.avif?t=1664741842\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073970/extras/cc9a10e3de1cdd6c02c93dc2719e40ae.webm?t=1664741842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073970/extras/cc9a10e3de1cdd6c02c93dc2719e40ae.mp4?t=1664741842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Unique abilities to use against thousands of creatures<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Environment</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073970/extras/e254e41fdb1961f917f722fb54becce1.poster.avif?t=1664741842\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073970/extras/e254e41fdb1961f917f722fb54becce1.webm?t=1664741842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073970/extras/e254e41fdb1961f917f722fb54becce1.mp4?t=1664741842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Animals and other materials create areas that give you temporary buffs<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Abilities</h2>Each hero has a different ability<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Necromancer summons skeletons<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073970/extras/f0fac603caca7311258d70724f0d9d14.poster.avif?t=1664741842\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073970/extras/f0fac603caca7311258d70724f0d9d14.webm?t=1664741842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073970/extras/f0fac603caca7311258d70724f0d9d14.mp4?t=1664741842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li>Yuri controls enemies<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073970/extras/9f70ce1d556c4c8f81f409fb08fb09fe.poster.avif?t=1664741842\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073970/extras/9f70ce1d556c4c8f81f409fb08fb09fe.webm?t=1664741842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073970/extras/9f70ce1d556c4c8f81f409fb08fb09fe.mp4?t=1664741842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>And many more character</li></ul>",
